              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Sarah Jo"
            },
            "reviewBody": "To make this more \"adult\" for your sans-kids celebrations, try this with a fifth of Fireball whiskey instead of the red hot candies. Same flavor but with a nice kick. This is VERY good either way."
          },
          {
            "@type": "Review",
            "reviewRating": {
              "@type": "Rating",
              "ratingValue": "5"
            },
            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "cookin'mama"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I cut the recipe in half and I still had a lot of fuss free cranberry tea! Taking another reviewer's suggestion I added some Fireball Schnapps to liven up the adult drinks a bit. This would be a great addition to an apre ski gathering!",
            "datePublished": "2009-12-02T07:03:10.150Z"
          },
          {
            "@type": "Review",
            "reviewRating": {
              "@type": "Rating",
