            },
            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Tami"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I used this recipe for our mother's day tea party for our mom's group. It went over well and made plenty! The only thing I had any problem with was the color. It looks a bit like tomato soup, however the taste is delicious. Not too syrupy sweet and not too strong of a tea flavor. Thanks for the recipe!",
            "datePublished": "2008-05-13T17:40:07.210Z"
          }
